Ticket 3 (detector) is verifiable via the real-data oracle but not demoable — you can't see anything until ticket 4. Keep them split or merge
into one tracer bullet?

❯ 1. Keep split (Recommended)
     3 = detector + oracle tests, 4 = card UI + accept. The detector carries the backtest against 256 sessions and is the substantive half;
     merging risks one oversized context window where the UI work crowds out oracle rigour.
